d counter. Numbers in your text will automatically count up from 0 when the block comes into view.</span></p></div><div style="padding: 12px; background-color: rgb(240, 246, 252); border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 16px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 115, 170);"><p style="margin: 0px 0px 8px 0px; font-size: 0.8125rem; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(0, 115, 170);">💡 How it works:</p><p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 0.75rem; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 1.4;">Just type your text with numbers like "5 years", "98%", or "$1,250". The system will automatically detect the numbers and animate them from 0 to the detected value.</p></div><div class="_94dff8a2f7c49fc8__wrapper components-base-control components-select-control"><div class="d9ac8e2c0db95cc7__field components-base-control__field"><div data-wp-c16t="true" data-wp-component="InputBase" class="e518617e7c3a18e7__flex f9694ed4faabfc82__items-column components-flex components-input-base e1mv6sxx3 css-1kjjl8q-Root-StyledInputBase em5sgkm5" style="--wp-components-flex-align: normal; --wp-components-flex-direction: column; --wp-components-flex-wrap: nowrap; --wp-components-flex-gap: calc(4px * 2); --wp-components-flex-justify: space-between;"><div data-wp-c16t="true" data-wp-component="FlexItem" class="bc09d0edcc10c304__item components-flex-item css-nrhbmn-LabelWrapper em5sgkm1" style="--wp-components-flex-item-display: block;"><label data-wp-c16t="true" data-wp-component="Text" for="inspector-select-control-26" class="components-truncate css-tf28v4-Text-base-textStyles components-text components-input-control__label css-w5emdr-BaseLabel-baseLabelTypography em5sgkm2">Animation Duration</label></div><div class="components-input-control__container css-f1w127-Container-containerDisabledStyles-containerWidthStyles em5sgkm4"><select aria-describedby="inspector-select-control-26__help" class="components-select-control__input css-1ulocc7-Select-fontSizeStyles-sizeStyles-rtl e1mv6sxx2" id="inspector-select-control-26"><option v